     Design spec section 3: "The breakpoint is ~600px, and is one of two
     figures that must be settled on real hardware -- see section 13. It is
     a starting point, not a decision." Still owed on real hardware
     (tracked in that section, not repeated here); the value below is that
     same starting point, unchanged.

